  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 308
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 心儿此前刚出林府，天星城便已是启动大阵封锁，老夫料想心儿也未能出城。但若是停留城中，暴露行踪也不过是时间问题。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114823084727816202}
  AvatarIntID: 1
