--- !u!114 &114150129166972246
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1406583191150910}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 314
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 心儿的大哥也是与其交情不浅，还是孩童之时算得上是往来密切。连带之下，雪儿与心儿也是与他熟稔起来。心儿若要找人帮忙，找他自是上上之选。
